{% comment %}
  FUEL_09 offer box on the single-perfume PDP. Rendered by a fuel09_offer_box
  block in sections/main-product.liquid, placed directly before the
  atc_bundle_builder block. One block instance is one look of the box: the
  Layout setting picks A (four cards), B (three cards and a benefits row) or
  C (B's cards with the page's own size tiles in place of the size choice).

  The box takes the place of the size tiles and nothing else. The add to cart
  form, its button and the theme's own size script stay as they are:
  assets/fuel09-offer.js clicks the hidden size tile to change size. The add
  to cart press itself is the script's, for the reason given below.

  The block names the sizes the box offers (100 and 50 ml as shipped). A size
  that is not named gets no tile, no price and no free shipping mark, and a
  form found on such a size is put on the box's opening size by the script.
  The box opens on 50 ml, which is not the size the page opens on: the script
  puts the form on it when the look comes on, and the page without the look
  keeps its own opening size.

  Gated six ways, all in Liquid: a perfume that can be bought (sold out in
  every size, the page has no add to cart button for the box to drive), the
  Swedish market only (every string in the block is written in Swedish, none
  of it is translated and the shipping figures are kronor; the country is
  asked as well as the language, because this store runs one language and is
  translated at the edge, so the language alone reads Swedish on the Danish,
  Finnish and Norwegian pages too), a product with more than one size, a product in one of the collections named in the
  block, never a bundle product (the metafield check), and only a template
  whose main section also holds the atc_bundle_builder block the box drives.
  On top of that the box ships hidden: assets/fuel09-offer.css opens look A
  behind html.ab-f09-v1 and look B behind html.ab-f09-v2, and both in the
  theme editor.

  Every layout sells a scent per bottle (layouts A and B since Oct 9, at
  the client's asking). The open card lists one slot per paid and free
  bottle: the first is the perfume of the page, the rest are chosen in the
  picker at the foot of this file, whose rows come from
  sections/fuel09-pool.liquid the first time it is opened. The bottles go
  into the cart one by one, each at its own price, with the card's discount
  code where the block names one; assets/fuel09-offer.js does that in place
  of the theme's own add, because a quantity can only repeat one perfume. A
  box offers only the named sizes this perfume has in stock and is left out
  on a perfume that has none.

  Layouts A and B choose the size in the open card, above the slots, and
  every bottle comes in that size. Layout C keeps the page's own size tiles
  instead: assets/fuel09-offer.js lifts them, heading row and all, to just
  above the box while the look is on and switches off the tiles of sizes
  the box does not offer. Layout C has no mystery bottle; A and B keep
  theirs, which is never a slot.

  Nothing is priced by hand. A card is price x bottles paid, plus the
  shipping cost while that stays under the free shipping limit, and the
  per-bottle figure is that amount over the bottles the card counts: the
  paid and the free ones, and the mystery ones too where the block says so
  (the two looks are drawn differently on this). The opening size's figures
  are printed here through the money filters; from there on the script
  writes them, the same sum over the scents chosen and the size on show.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} the product being viewed (required)
  - section: {Object} the hosting section, to find its atc_bundle_builder
    block (required; without it nothing renders)
  - block: {Object} the fuel09_offer_box block carrying the settings (required)
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign fuel09_layout = block.settings.layout
  assign fuel09_render = false

  if fuel09_layout == 'a' or fuel09_layout == 'b' or fuel09_layout == 'c'
    if request.locale.iso_code == 'sv' and localization.country.iso_code == 'SE' and product.available and product.variants.size > 1 and product.metafields.custom.choose_your_fragrances_options == blank
      assign fuel09_buy_area = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'atc_bundle_builder' | first
      if fuel09_buy_area
        assign fuel09_render = true
      endif
    endif
  endif

  if fuel09_render and block.settings.collections != blank
    assign fuel09_render = false
    assign fuel09_product_handles = product.collections | map: 'handle'
    assign fuel09_wanted_handles = block.settings.collections | split: ','
    for fuel09_wanted_handle in fuel09_wanted_handles
      assign fuel09_handle = fuel09_wanted_handle | strip
      if fuel09_handle != blank and fuel09_product_handles contains fuel09_handle
        assign fuel09_render = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    The sizes the box offers: a size whose name holds one of the block's
    words, and every size while the block names none or no size of this
    perfume carries any of them. Kept as two lists a loop can ask with
    "contains": the ids, and "word:id:price" per size, the word being what
    a size is called across perfumes (sections/fuel09-pool.liquid prints
    the same words). The bottles are added through the cart itself, so a
    size also has to be in stock to be listed. A perfume with none of the
    offered sizes in stock gets no box: the page keeps its own size tiles,
    and a size the box does not offer can still be bought there.
  endcomment
  assign fuel09_picks = false
  assign fuel09_offered = ' '
  assign fuel09_keyed = ''
  assign fuel09_named = false
  assign fuel09_in_stock = false
  if fuel09_render
    assign fuel09_picks = true
    assign fuel09_size_words = block.settings.sizes | downcase | split: ','
    for fuel09_size_word in fuel09_size_words
      assign fuel09_word = fuel09_size_word | strip | remove: ' ' | remove: ':'
      if fuel09_word == blank
        continue
      endif
      for variant in product.variants
        assign fuel09_title_down = variant.title | downcase
        assign fuel09_id_mark = ' ' | append: variant.id | append: ' '
        if fuel09_title_down contains fuel09_word
          assign fuel09_named = true
          unless fuel09_offered contains fuel09_id_mark
            if variant.available
              assign fuel09_in_stock = true
            endif
            if variant.available or fuel09_picks == false
              assign fuel09_offered = fuel09_offered | append: variant.id | append: ' '
              assign fuel09_keyed = fuel09_keyed | append: fuel09_word | append: ':' | append: variant.id | append: ':' | append: variant.price | append: ' '
            endif
          endunless
        endif
      endfor
    endfor
    if fuel09_named == false
      for variant in product.variants
        if variant.available
          assign fuel09_in_stock = true
        endif
        if variant.available or fuel09_picks == false
          assign fuel09_word = variant.title | downcase | remove: ' ' | remove: ':'
          assign fuel09_offered = fuel09_offered | append: variant.id | append: ' '
          assign fuel09_keyed = fuel09_keyed | append: fuel09_word | append: ':' | append: variant.id | append: ':' | append: variant.price | append: ' '
        endif
      endfor
    endif
    assign fuel09_keyed = fuel09_keyed | strip
    if fuel09_in_stock == false
      assign fuel09_render = false
    endif
  endif

  comment
    Exactly one card opens selected: the first one ticked in the settings,
    or the first card that is switched on when none is.
  endcomment
  assign fuel09_first_card = 0
  assign fuel09_selected_card = 0
  if fuel09_render
    for i in (1..4)
      assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_paid'
      assign fuel09_paid = block.settings[fuel09_key] | default: 0 | plus: 0
      if fuel09_paid < 1
        continue
      endif
      if fuel09_first_card == 0
        assign fuel09_first_card = i
      endif
      assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_selected'
      if block.settings[fuel09_key] and fuel09_selected_card == 0
        assign fuel09_selected_card = i
      endif
    endfor
    if fuel09_selected_card == 0
      assign fuel09_selected_card = fuel09_first_card
    endif
    if fuel09_first_card == 0
      assign fuel09_render = false
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if fuel09_render -%}
  {%- liquid
    comment
      The size the page opens on, picked the way
      snippets/reactive-variant-selector.liquid picks it (the 100 ml size
      while it is in stock, the first size in stock otherwise). That is the
      id sitting in the form when the page loads.
    endcomment
    assign fuel09_page_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
    for variant in product.variants
      assign fuel09_title_down = variant.title | downcase
      if fuel09_title_down contains '100' and variant.available
        assign fuel09_page_variant = variant
        break
      endif
    endfor

    comment
      The size the box opens on: 50 ml while the box offers it and it is in
      stock, the page's own opening size otherwise, and where the box does
      not offer that one either, the first size in stock it does offer. The
      figures on show are this size's, and the script puts the form on it
      when the look comes on.
    endcomment
    assign fuel09_open_word = '50'
    assign fuel09_variant = fuel09_page_variant
    for variant in product.variants
      assign fuel09_title_down = variant.title | downcase
      assign fuel09_variant_mark = ' ' | append: variant.id | append: ' '
      if fuel09_title_down contains fuel09_open_word and variant.available and fuel09_offered contains fuel09_variant_mark
        assign fuel09_variant = variant
        break
      endif
    endfor
    assign fuel09_id_mark = ' ' | append: fuel09_variant.id | append: ' '
    unless fuel09_offered contains fuel09_id_mark and fuel09_variant.available
      for variant in product.variants
        assign fuel09_variant_mark = ' ' | append: variant.id | append: ' '
        if fuel09_offered contains fuel09_variant_mark and variant.available
          assign fuel09_variant = variant
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endunless

    assign fuel09_look_class = 'ab-f09-v1'
    if fuel09_layout == 'b'
      assign fuel09_look_class = 'ab-f09-v2'
    elsif fuel09_layout == 'c'
      assign fuel09_look_class = 'ab-f09-v3'
    endif

    assign fuel09_shipping = block.settings.shipping_cost | default: 0 | times: 100
    assign fuel09_free_from = block.settings.free_shipping_from | default: 0 | times: 100

    comment
      The short name under a slot is the perfume's number, and the picker's
      rows are asked for per collection named in the block.
    endcomment
    if fuel09_picks
      assign fuel09_short = product.title
      if product.title contains 'No.'
        assign fuel09_short = product.title | split: 'No.' | last | strip | prepend: 'No. '
      endif
      assign fuel09_pick_image = fuel09_variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_image
      assign fuel09_pool = ''
      assign fuel09_pool_handles = block.settings.collections | default: 'best-sellers' | split: ','
      for fuel09_pool_handle in fuel09_pool_handles
        assign fuel09_handle = fuel09_pool_handle | strip
        if fuel09_handle != blank
          assign fuel09_pool = fuel09_pool | append: routes.collections_url | append: '/' | append: fuel09_handle | append: '?section_id=fuel09-pool '
        endif
      endfor
      assign fuel09_pool = fuel09_pool | strip
    endif
  -%}

  {{ 'fuel09-offer.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <script src="{{ 'fuel09-offer.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

  <fuel09-box
    id="fuel09-box-{{ block.id }}"
    class="fuel09-box fuel09-box--{{ fuel09_layout }}"
    data-look-class="{{ fuel09_look_class }}"
    data-open-id="{{ fuel09_variant.id }}"
    data-page-id="{{ fuel09_page_variant.id }}"
    data-mystery-item-id="{{ block.settings.mystery_item_id | escape }}"
    data-mystery-code="{{ block.settings.mystery_code | escape }}"
    {% if fuel09_picks %}
      data-pick-product="{{ product.id }}"
      data-pick-sizes="{{ fuel09_keyed | escape }}"
      data-shipping="{{ fuel09_shipping | round }}"
      data-free-from="{{ fuel09_free_from | round }}"
      data-money-format="{{ shop.money_format | strip_html | escape }}"
      data-pool="{{ fuel09_pool | escape }}"
      data-left-text="{{ block.settings.picks_left_text | escape }}"
      data-done-text="{{ block.settings.picks_done_text | escape }}"
      data-per-bottle-text="{{ block.settings.per_bottle_text | escape }}"
      data-error-text="{{ block.settings.picker_error | escape }}"
    {% endif %}
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <div class="fuel09-box__panel">
      {%- if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <div class="fuel09-box__header">
          {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <span class="fuel09-box__heading" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="fuel09-box__heading-icon">
                {{- 'fuel09-gift-header.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
              </span>
              <span class="fuel09-box__heading-text">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</span>
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.subheading != blank -%}
            <span class="fuel09-box__subheading" id="fuel09-note-{{ block.id }}">
              {{- block.settings.subheading | escape -}}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="fuel09-box__content">
        <fieldset
          class="fuel09-box__cards"
          {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
            aria-describedby="fuel09-note-{{ block.id }}"
          {% endif %}>
          <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ block.settings.heading | default: product.title | escape }}</legend>

          {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_paid'
              assign fuel09_paid = block.settings[fuel09_key] | default: 0 | plus: 0
              if fuel09_paid < 1
                continue
              endif
              assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_free'
              assign fuel09_free = block.settings[fuel09_key] | default: 0 | at_least: 0
              assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_mystery'
              assign fuel09_mystery = block.settings[fuel09_key] | default: 0 | at_least: 0
              assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_badge'
              assign fuel09_badge = block.settings[fuel09_key]
              assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_free_shipping'
              assign fuel09_free_shipping = block.settings[fuel09_key]

              comment
                The quantity is the paid and the free bottles. The mystery
                bottle is another product, so it is drawn in the row but never
                in the quantity: the card carries its count (data-mystery)
                and assets/fuel09-offer.js adds that many. Whether it counts in the
                card's bottle total and per-bottle figure is the block's
                call: look A's frame leaves it out, look B's counts it.
              endcomment
              assign fuel09_quantity = fuel09_paid | plus: fuel09_free
              assign fuel09_drawn = fuel09_quantity | plus: fuel09_mystery
              assign fuel09_bottles = fuel09_quantity
              if block.settings.count_mystery
                assign fuel09_bottles = fuel09_drawn
              endif

              comment
                A card can name another free count than the one it adds: look
                B's middle card is 2 paid, 2 free and 1 mystery and reads
                "KÖP 2, FÅ 3".
              endcomment
              assign fuel09_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_free_shown'
              assign fuel09_free_shown = block.settings[fuel09_key] | default: 0 | plus: 0
              if fuel09_free_shown < 1
                assign fuel09_free_shown = fuel09_free
              endif

              comment
                The sizes at which this card ships free, worked out the way
                the price below works out when the shipping cost is added.
                The pill is only true for those.
              endcomment
              assign fuel09_free_sizes = ''
              assign fuel09_free_now = false
              for variant in product.variants
                assign fuel09_variant_mark = ' ' | append: variant.id | append: ' '
                unless fuel09_offered contains fuel09_variant_mark
                  continue
                endunless
                assign fuel09_total = variant.price | times: fuel09_paid
                if fuel09_shipping == 0 or fuel09_total >= fuel09_free_from
                  assign fuel09_free_sizes = fuel09_free_sizes | append: variant.id | append: ' '
                  if variant.id == fuel09_variant.id
                    assign fuel09_free_now = true
                  endif
                endif
              endfor
              assign fuel09_free_sizes = fuel09_free_sizes | strip

              assign fuel09_title = block.settings.title_text | replace: '[paid]', fuel09_paid | replace: '[free]', fuel09_free_shown
              assign fuel09_count_line = block.settings.total_text | replace: '[total]', fuel09_bottles
              assign fuel09_included = block.settings.included_text | replace: '[paid]', fuel09_paid | replace: '[free]', fuel09_free_shown
              assign fuel09_mystery_line = block.settings.mystery_text | replace: '[n]', fuel09_mystery

              assign fuel09_card_id = 'fuel09-' | append: block.id | append: '-' | append: i
              assign fuel09_code_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_code'

              comment
                Layout C draws and counts no mystery bottle, whatever the
                card's settings say: every bottle of it is a chosen one.
              endcomment
              if fuel09_layout == 'c'
                assign fuel09_mystery = 0
                assign fuel09_drawn = fuel09_quantity
                assign fuel09_bottles = fuel09_quantity
                assign fuel09_count_line = block.settings.total_text | replace: '[total]', fuel09_bottles
              endif

              comment
                A slot per paid and free bottle. The mystery bottle is the
                store's choice, so it is never a slot, also where the card
                counts it in its bottle total.
              endcomment
              assign fuel09_slots = fuel09_quantity
            -%}
            <div
              class="fuel09-card{% if fuel09_drawn >= 6 %} fuel09-card--long{% endif %}"
              data-quantity="{{ fuel09_quantity }}"
              {% if fuel09_mystery > 0 %}
                data-mystery="{{ fuel09_mystery }}"
              {% endif %}
              {% if fuel09_picks %}
                data-paid="{{ fuel09_paid }}"
                data-bottles="{{ fuel09_slots }}"
                data-counted="{{ fuel09_bottles }}"
              {% endif %}
              data-code="{{ block.settings[fuel09_code_key] | strip | escape }}">
              <input
                type="radio"
                class="fuel09-card__input visually-hidden"
                id="{{ fuel09_card_id }}"
                name="fuel09-offer-{{ block.id }}"
                value="{{ i }}"
                {% if i == fuel09_selected_card %}
                  checked
                {% endif %}>
              <label class="fuel09-card__summary" for="{{ fuel09_card_id }}">
                <span class="fuel09-card__radio" aria-hidden="true">
                  {%- unless fuel09_layout == 'c' -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-card__radio-on">
                      {{- 'fuel09-radio-on.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </span>
                  {%- endunless -%}
                  {%- if fuel09_layout == 'b' -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-card__radio-on fuel09-card__radio-on--wide">
                      {{- 'fuel09-radio-on-b.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </span>
                  {%- elsif fuel09_layout == 'c' -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-card__radio-on fuel09-card__radio-on--pick">
                      {{- 'fuel09-radio-on-c.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>

                <span class="fuel09-card__details">
                  {%- if fuel09_title != blank -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-card__title">{{ fuel09_title | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if fuel09_count_line != blank -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-card__count">{{ fuel09_count_line | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <span class="fuel09-card__perks">
                    {%- if fuel09_included != blank -%}
                      <span class="fuel09-card__included">{{ fuel09_included | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {%- if fuel09_picks and fuel09_free_shipping and block.settings.shipping_pill_text != blank -%}
                      <span
                        class="fuel09-pill fuel09-pill--shipping"
                        data-fuel09-free-pill
                        {% unless fuel09_free_now %}
                          hidden
                        {% endunless %}>
                        <span class="fuel09-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                          {{- 'fuel09-truck.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                        {{- block.settings.shipping_pill_text | escape -}}
                      </span>
                    {%- elsif fuel09_free_shipping and fuel09_free_sizes != blank and block.settings.shipping_pill_text != blank -%}
                      <span
                        class="fuel09-pill fuel09-pill--shipping"
                        data-fuel09-free-sizes="{{ fuel09_free_sizes }}"
                        {% unless fuel09_free_now %}
                          hidden
                        {% endunless %}>
                        <span class="fuel09-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                          {{- 'fuel09-truck.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                        {{- block.settings.shipping_pill_text | escape -}}
                      </span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {%- if fuel09_mystery > 0 and fuel09_mystery_line != blank -%}
                      <span class="fuel09-pill fuel09-pill--mystery">
                        <span class="fuel09-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                          {{- 'fuel09-gift.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                        {{- fuel09_mystery_line | escape -}}
                      </span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                </span>

                <span
                  class="fuel09-bottles{% if fuel09_drawn >= 9 %} fuel09-bottles--dense{% endif %}{% if fuel09_drawn >= 10 %} fuel09-bottles--denser{% endif %}"
                  aria-hidden="true">
                  {%- for n in (1..fuel09_quantity) -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-bottle">
                      <span class="fuel09-bottle__cap"></span>
                      <span class="fuel09-bottle__neck"></span>
                      <span class="fuel09-bottle__body"><span class="fuel09-bottle__label"></span></span>
                    </span>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- if fuel09_mystery > 0 -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-bottles__plus">
                      {{- 'fuel09-plus.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </span>
                    {%- for n in (1..fuel09_mystery) -%}
                      <span class="fuel09-bottle fuel09-bottle--mystery">
                        <span class="fuel09-bottle__cap"></span>
                        <span class="fuel09-bottle__neck"></span>
                        <span class="fuel09-bottle__body"><span class="fuel09-bottle__mark">?</span></span>
                      </span>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>

                <span class="fuel09-card__prices">
                  {%- if fuel09_badge != blank -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-card__badge">{{ fuel09_badge | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      assign fuel09_variant_mark = ' ' | append: variant.id | append: ' '
                      unless fuel09_offered contains fuel09_variant_mark
                        continue
                      endunless
                      comment
                        The opening size only: the figures depend on the
                        scents chosen, so the script writes them from there
                        on, size changes included.
                      endcomment
                      if fuel09_picks and variant.id != fuel09_variant.id
                        continue
                      endif
                      assign fuel09_total = variant.price | times: fuel09_paid
                      assign fuel09_shown = fuel09_total
                      if fuel09_shipping > 0 and fuel09_total < fuel09_free_from
                        assign fuel09_shown = fuel09_total | plus: fuel09_shipping
                      endif
                      assign fuel09_per_bottle = fuel09_shown | times: 1.0 | divided_by: fuel09_bottles | round
                      assign fuel09_per_bottle_money = fuel09_per_bottle | money_without_trailing_zeros
                      assign fuel09_per_bottle_line = block.settings.per_bottle_text | escape | replace: '[price]', fuel09_per_bottle_money
                    -%}
                    <span
                      class="fuel09-card__price"
                      data-fuel09-price="{{ variant.id }}"
                      data-atc-price="{{ fuel09_shown | money | strip_html | escape }}"
                      {% unless variant.id == fuel09_variant.id %}
                        hidden
                      {% endunless %}>
                      <span class="fuel09-card__total" data-fuel09-total>{{ fuel09_shown | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span>
                      {%- if fuel09_per_bottle_line != blank -%}
                        <span class="fuel09-card__per" data-fuel09-per>{{ fuel09_per_bottle_line }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if block.settings.shipping_note != blank -%}
                        <span class="fuel09-card__shipping">{{ block.settings.shipping_note | escape }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </span>
              </label>

              {%- unless fuel09_layout == 'c' -%}
              <div class="fuel09-card__sizes">
                <span class="fuel09-card__sizes-label" id="{{ fuel09_card_id }}-sizes">
                  {{- block.settings.size_heading | escape -}}
                </span>
                <div class="fuel09-sizes" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="{{ fuel09_card_id }}-sizes">
                  {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      assign fuel09_variant_mark = ' ' | append: variant.id | append: ' '
                      unless fuel09_offered contains fuel09_variant_mark
                        continue
                      endunless
                      comment
                        The size in ml and the price per ml, read the way the
                        size tiles this box stands in for read them.
                      endcomment
                      assign fuel09_ml = 0
                      if variant.title contains '100'
                        assign fuel09_ml = 100
                      elsif variant.title contains '50'
                        assign fuel09_ml = 50
                      elsif variant.title contains '30'
                        assign fuel09_ml = 30
                      endif
                      if fuel09_ml > 0
                        assign fuel09_per_ml = variant.price | times: 1.0 | divided_by: fuel09_ml
                      endif
                      assign fuel09_tabbed = false
                      if fuel09_ml == 100 and block.settings.size_badge != blank
                        assign fuel09_tabbed = true
                      endif
                    -%}
                    <label class="fuel09-size{% if fuel09_tabbed %} fuel09-size--tabbed{% endif %}">
                      <input
                        type="radio"
                        class="fuel09-size__input visually-hidden"
                        name="fuel09-size-{{ block.id }}-{{ i }}"
                        value="{{ variant.id }}"
                        {% if variant.id == fuel09_variant.id %}
                          checked
                        {% endif %}>
                      <span class="fuel09-size__box">
                        {%- if fuel09_tabbed -%}
                          <span class="fuel09-size__tab">{{ block.settings.size_badge | escape }}</span>
                        {%- endif -%}
                        <span class="fuel09-size__name">{{ variant.title | escape }}</span>
                        {%- if fuel09_ml > 0 -%}
                          <span class="fuel09-size__rate">{{ fuel09_per_ml | money }} / ml</span>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </span>
                    </label>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
              </div>
              {%- endunless -%}

              {%- if fuel09_picks -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign fuel09_left = fuel09_slots | minus: 1
                  assign fuel09_picks_heading = block.settings.picks_heading | replace: '[total]', fuel09_slots
                  assign fuel09_left_line = block.settings.picks_left_text | replace: '[n]', fuel09_left
                  if fuel09_left < 1
                    assign fuel09_left_line = block.settings.picks_done_text
                  endif
                -%}
                <div class="fuel09-card__picks">
                  <div class="fuel09-picks__head">
                    {%- if fuel09_picks_heading != blank -%}
                      <span class="fuel09-picks__title" id="{{ fuel09_card_id }}-picks">{{ fuel09_picks_heading | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-picks__left" data-fuel09-left aria-live="polite">{{ fuel09_left_line | escape }}</span>
                  </div>
                  <ul
                    class="fuel09-picks__list"
                    role="list"
                    {% if fuel09_picks_heading != blank %}
                      aria-labelledby="{{ fuel09_card_id }}-picks"
                    {% endif %}>
                    {%- for n in (1..fuel09_slots) -%}
                      <li
                        class="fuel09-pick{% if n == 1 %} fuel09-pick--set fuel09-pick--own{% endif %}"
                        data-fuel09-slot="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                        <button type="button" class="fuel09-pick__add" data-fuel09-open{% if n == 1 %} hidden{% endif %}>
                          <span class="fuel09-pick__frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                          <span class="fuel09-pick__label">{{ block.settings.pick_empty_label | escape }}</span>
                        </button>
                        <span class="fuel09-pick__set"{% unless n == 1 %} hidden{% endunless %}>
                          <span class="fuel09-pick__frame">
                            {%- if n == 1 and fuel09_pick_image -%}
                              {{ fuel09_pick_image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: class: 'fuel09-pick__image', alt: '', loading: 'lazy', widths: '80, 160', sizes: '72px' }}
                            {%- else -%}
                              <img class="fuel09-pick__image" alt="" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy" hidden>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </span>
                          <span class="fuel09-pick__name" data-fuel09-name>{% if n == 1 %}{{ fuel09_short | escape }}{% endif %}</span>
                          <span class="fuel09-pick__state">
                            <span class="fuel09-pick__tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="fuel09-pick__added">{{ block.settings.pick_added_label | escape }}</span>
                          </span>
                          {%- unless n == 1 -%}
                            <button
                              type="button"
                              class="fuel09-pick__remove"
                              data-fuel09-remove
                              data-label="{{ block.settings.pick_remove_label | escape }}"
                              aria-label="{{ block.settings.pick_remove_label | replace: '[name]', '' | strip | escape }}">
                              <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                            </button>
                          {%- endunless -%}
                        </span>
                      </li>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </ul>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </fieldset>

        {%- if fuel09_layout == 'b' or fuel09_layout == 'c' -%}
          {%- capture fuel09_benefits -%}
            {%- for n in (1..3) -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign fuel09_key = 'benefit_' | append: n | append: '_title'
                assign fuel09_benefit_title = block.settings[fuel09_key]
                assign fuel09_key = 'benefit_' | append: n | append: '_text'
                assign fuel09_benefit_text = block.settings[fuel09_key]
              -%}
              {%- if fuel09_benefit_title != blank or fuel09_benefit_text != blank -%}
                <li class="fuel09-benefit">
                  <span class="fuel09-benefit__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- if n == 2 -%}
                      {{- 'fuel09-truck.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    {%- else -%}
                      {{- 'fuel09-gift-benefit.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                  {%- if fuel09_benefit_title != blank -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-benefit__title">{{ fuel09_benefit_title | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if fuel09_benefit_text != blank -%}
                    <span class="fuel09-benefit__text">{{ fuel09_benefit_text | escape }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endcapture -%}
          {%- if fuel09_benefits != blank -%}
            <ul class="fuel09-benefits">
              {{- fuel09_benefits -}}
            </ul>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if fuel09_picks -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        The picker. One for the whole box: the open card decides how many
        slots it fills. A native dialog, so the page behind it is inert, Tab
        stays inside it and Escape closes it without a line of script.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <dialog class="fuel09-picker" aria-labelledby="fuel09-picker-{{ block.id }}">
        <div class="fuel09-picker__head">
          <span class="fuel09-picker__title" id="fuel09-picker-{{ block.id }}">{{ block.settings.picker_title | escape }}</span>
          <span class="fuel09-picker__left" data-fuel09-left aria-live="polite"></span>
          <button type="button" class="fuel09-picker__close" data-fuel09-close aria-label="{{ block.settings.picker_close | escape }}">
            <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <label class="fuel09-picker__search">
          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ block.settings.picker_search | escape }}</span>
          <input
            type="search"
            class="fuel09-picker__input"
            data-fuel09-search
            placeholder="{{ block.settings.picker_search | escape }}"
            autocomplete="off">
        </label>
        <div class="fuel09-picker__body" data-fuel09-list tabindex="-1">
          <p class="fuel09-picker__status" data-fuel09-status role="status">{{ block.settings.picker_loading | escape }}</p>
          <p class="fuel09-picker__status" data-fuel09-none hidden>{{ block.settings.picker_none | escape }}</p>
        </div>
      </dialog>
    {%- endif -%}
  </fuel09-box>
{%- endif -%}
